WEBVTT

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:36.880 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:39.940 line:0%
[Episode 2]

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:42.710 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:43.040 line:0%
Sir,

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:45.000 line:0%
the grand empress dowager has arranged a marriage for you.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.660 line:0%
Should we make preparations?

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:47.570 line:0%
Uncle Zhong,

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:48.960 line:0%
you don't need to worry about that.

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:50.160 line:0%
As long as I'm here,

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:51.160 line:0%
she won't be able to enter the mansion.

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:52.360 line:0%
Do you plan

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:53.920 line:0%
to scare her through the ghostly trick

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:55.850 line:0%
of throwing heads and darts again?

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:58.680 line:0%
This time, it's a marriage arranged by the grand empress dowager.

00:01:58.680 --> 00:01:59.680 line:0%
Wouldn't it be...

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:02.000 line:0%
So what?

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:02.920 line:0%
As usual,

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.130 line:0%
I'll scare her away!

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:12.970 line:0%
Minister Zhang,

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:13.640 line:0%
this...

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:14.400 line:0%
Enough.

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:15.960 line:0%
Say no more.

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:17.600 line:0%
Just do as I said.

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:25.920 line:0%
Dr. Yan,

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:27.800 line:0%
you're a sensible person.

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:28.860 line:0%
You surely won't betray

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:30.780 line:0%
my trust in you.

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:32.890 line:0%
Rest assured, Minister Zhang.

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:38.900 line:0%
Close the gate.

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:44.200 line:0%
Honey.

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:47.840 line:0%
Minister Zhang came in person.

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:49.120 line:0%
Why?

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:51.040 line:0%
Shen Du has always been neutral

00:02:51.379 --> 00:02:53.480 line:0%
in the court.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:56.520 line:0%
He's always been like that especially in the competition

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:57.960 line:0%
between Prince Xian and Princess Ying.

00:02:57.960 --> 00:02:59.720 line:0%
Minister Zhang is Prince Xian's strategist.

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:01.120 line:0%
He picked Caiwei this time.

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:03.580 line:0%
Surely it isn't just for her talent.

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:05.720 line:0%
He wants Caiwei to be a spy?

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:06.960 line:0%
Lower your voice.

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:09.160 line:0%
No way.

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:11.160 line:0%
Caiwei definitely can't marry him.

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:13.400 line:0%
Minister Zhang just mentioned to me again

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:15.320 line:0%
about the re-election of the six ministries.

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:16.560 line:0%
If Caiwei doesn't marry him,

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:17.440 line:0%
during the re-election,

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:19.240 line:0%
they'll pick me to garrison the desert.

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:21.560 line:0%
And our whole family will have to go.

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:23.000 line:0%
Minister Zhang actually

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:24.760 line:0%
threatened Father with exiling our whole family to the desert.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:26.000 line:0%
Master! Madam!

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:26.720 line:0%
Bad news!

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:28.680 line:0%
Lady Caiwei... Lady Caiwei ran away!

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:29.400 line:0%
She said

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:30.740 line:0%
she eloped with a scholar

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:31.750 line:0%
named Han Shiyuan.

00:03:31.629 --> 00:03:33.790 line:0%
[Han Shiyuan is a good husband, and I've left with him.]

00:03:31.629 --> 00:03:33.790 line:0%
[Father, Mr. Han and I love each other, and we've secretly pledged to spend our lives together.]

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:37.600 line:0%
This rebellious daughter!

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:38.560 line:0%
Master!

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:39.560 line:0%
-Honey!
-Father!

00:03:39.879 --> 00:03:41.080 line:0%
-Master!
-Honey!

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:41.800 line:0%
Father!

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.760 line:0%
Why are you all looking at me?

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:58.129 line:0%
You've found Caiwei?

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:05.160 line:0%
If not, hurry up and go look for her!

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:06.880 line:0%
Even if you have to turn Xiang'an City upside down,

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:07.680 line:0%
you must bring that rebellious girl

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:08.920 line:0%
back to me!

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:13.360 line:0%
Everyone, look for her thoroughly.

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:14.880 line:0%
Hurry! Go now! Go!

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:15.640 line:0%
Wait!

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:18.930 line:0%
Keep it a secret.

00:04:19.520 --> 00:04:20.680 line:0%
We can't let anyone else know

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:22.280 line:0%
that Caiwei is missing.

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:23.640 line:0%
That's right.

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:25.760 line:0%
We can't tell anyone else Caiwei ran away.

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:26.760 line:0%
Just tell them...

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:29.440 line:0%
Xing's pet rabbit is missing.

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:31.160 line:0%
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:37.600 line:0%
Xing.

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:40.240 line:0%
You get around often and are familiar

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:41.400 line:0%
with the surroundings.

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:43.000 line:0%
You're also close to Caiwei.

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:45.400 line:0%
Go out and look for her too.

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:46.280 line:0%
Okay.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:49.400 line:0%
Then... I'm going to look for the rabbit as well.

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:49.800 line:0%
Okay.

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:40.920 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:46.640 line:0%
Does the Yan family forbid

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:48.320 line:0%
a concubine's daughter to go home?

00:06:48.320 --> 00:06:50.720 line:0%
Why are you always running around outside?

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.760 line:0%
Grand Commander, please step aside.

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:56.040 line:0%
My rabbit is missing.

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:57.100 line:0%
I need to go find it.

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:58.280 line:0%
Really?

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:01.170 line:0%
So it's a rabbit that went missing.

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:03.480 line:0%
Today, the gate

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:05.560 line:0%
of the Yan family has been closed all day long.

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:06.360 line:0%
I thought you were

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:08.240 line:0%
busy preparing for the wedding.

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:12.890 line:0%
It turns out you closed the gate just to look for a rabbit.

00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:16.760 line:0%
If you've finished mocking me,

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:18.000 line:0%
I'll go and continue to look for it.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.720 line:0%
Well, you'd better find it.

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:22.440 line:0%
Tomorrow is the wedding day

00:07:22.440 --> 00:07:23.970 line:0%
of me and your third sister.

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:25.440 line:0%
I'm really

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.160 line:0%
looking forward to seeing you

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:31.200 line:0%
at the wedding with your rabbit.

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:45.520 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:46.800 line:0%
no offense,

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:48.120 line:0%
but I want to ask you for a favor.

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:49.320 line:0%
Asking me for a favor?

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:53.520 line:0%
Apart from the prisoners in jail

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.160 line:0%
who are desperate to die,

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:56.360 line:0%
I'm afraid

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:58.800 line:0%
no one else across Cang State

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:00.640 line:0%
would want to ask me for a favor.

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:05.480 line:0%
Please break off the engagement with my third sister.

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:15.570 line:0%
Do you know what you're talking about?

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:16.640 line:0%
I do.

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:18.520 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:20.400 line:0%
please cancel the marriage arrangement with my third sister.

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:22.730 line:0%
Although you don't hold an official rank,

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:23.680 line:0%
you are at least

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:25.210 line:0%
a literate minor official.

00:08:25.220 --> 00:08:26.560 line:0%
Do you understand that imperial orders

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:28.000 line:0%
can't be disobeyed?

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:33.040 line:0%
The grand empress dowager has given the order.

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:35.500 line:0%
You can't cancel it just because you want to.

00:08:37.589 --> 00:08:38.880 line:0%
The grand empress dowager

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:40.830 line:0%
favors you a lot.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.520 line:0%
She naturally wants to arrange

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:43.760 line:0%
a good marriage for you.

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:44.560 line:0%
That's right.

00:08:45.760 --> 00:08:48.480 line:0%
The grand empress dowager picked her through careful consideration,

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:50.520 line:0%
and Minister Zhang has vouched for it.

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:52.040 line:0%
I believe that your third sister and I

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:53.480 line:0%
will surely make a good match.

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:54.560 line:0%
That's because the grand empress dowager

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:55.720 line:0%
doesn't know what the Yan family's girls

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:57.080 line:0%
are really like.

00:08:57.410 --> 00:08:58.880 line:0%
As you can see, I'm so vulgar and disrespectful,

00:08:58.880 --> 00:08:59.880 line:0%
so you should know

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:01.680 line:0%
my third sister and you

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:03.340 line:0%
would never make a good match.

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:09.520 line:0%
Are you saying

00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:13.690 line:0%
your third sister's talent and virtues are all a pretense?

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:14.900 line:0%
If so,

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:17.280 line:0%
you've committed a crime by deceiving the emperor.

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:18.080 line:0%
I...

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:19.720 line:0%
I was talking about myself.

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:21.720 line:0%
You are indeed vulgar and disrespectful,

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:23.980 line:0%
but you're not the one I'm about to marry.

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:26.040 line:0%
I feel sorry for your third sister.

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:27.120 line:0%
She has such a disrespectful

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:28.560 line:0%
younger sister.

00:09:30.760 --> 00:09:31.720 line:0%
But you and my third sister

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:32.840 line:0%
have never met.

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:33.980 line:0%
Aren't you worried

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:35.360 line:0%
that you won't love each other

00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:37.560 line:0%
and you'll end up as a resentful couple?

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:40.010 line:0%
What does it matter?

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:41.920 line:0%
How can it not matter?

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:45.240 line:0%
People should be with someone

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:46.080 line:0%
they love,

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:48.530 line:0%
treating each other with respect

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:50.060 line:0%
and cherishing each other.

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:51.960 line:0%
Only then can they be happy.

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:04.530 line:0%
It's not important.

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:05.280 line:0%
You...

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:11.000 line:0%
You're simply hopeless

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:12.140 line:0%
and unreasonable!

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:13.000 line:0%
How dare you!

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:14.880 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:18.000 line:0%
even though I didn't want to believe

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:19.200 line:0%
the rumors about you,

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:22.160 line:0%
look at how you are now:

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:24.080 line:0%
harsh in words,

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:25.880 line:0%
irrational in behavior,

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:27.000 line:0%
tyrannical,

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:28.400 line:0%
and unreasonable.

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:29.680 line:0%
Even if my third sister

00:10:29.680 --> 00:10:31.540 line:0%
doesn't have anyone in her heart,

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:33.280 line:0%
she would never marry you!

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:52.970 line:0%
Treat each other with respect

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:55.440 line:0%
and cherish each other?

00:10:57.900 --> 00:10:59.200 line:0%
Those things

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:02.720 line:0%
are already too far from me.

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:27.570 line:0%
Mother,

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:29.580 line:0%
one day,

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.640 line:0%
I will move you to the noblest

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:33.610 line:0%
[Bi Luo]

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:34.170 line:0%
and the most luxurious cemetery in the world,

00:11:34.220 --> 00:11:36.680 line:0%
where you'll receive countless offerings.

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:40.000 line:0%
[Bi Luo]

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:40.480 line:0%
My Lord,

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:42.280 line:0%
everything is ready.

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:00.320 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:12:00.680 --> 00:12:01.720 line:0%
Yan Xing's words

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:02.800 line:0%
may be unpleasant,

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:03.810 line:0%
but...

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:04.800 line:0%
you don't want

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:05.840 line:0%
this marriage either, right?

00:12:05.840 --> 00:12:07.480 line:0%
Since they already asked you to break off the engagement

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:08.720 line:0%
before we scare her,

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:12.640 line:0%
why don't you just go along with it?

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:14.170 line:0%
Of course I can't marry her.

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:17.520 line:0%
But I can't

00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:21.850 line:0%
be the one to break off the engagement.

00:12:22.560 --> 00:12:23.360 line:0%
That's right.

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:25.160 line:0%
The grand empress dowager arranged this marriage.

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:27.020 line:0%
Of course you should be grateful.

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:28.280 line:0%
We need to make the Yan family

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:30.280 line:0%
take the initiative to break off the engagement.

00:12:30.280 --> 00:12:31.680 line:0%
According to our men,

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:33.480 line:0%
Yan Caiwei

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:34.880 line:0%
eloped with that scholar.

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:36.740 line:0%
They still haven't found her yet.

00:12:36.760 --> 00:12:38.040 line:0%
Even if they won't break off the engagement,

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:39.200 line:0%
tomorrow's bride fetching ceremony

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:40.760 line:0%
will naturally be canceled, right?

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:41.960 line:0%
They're in the wrong,

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:43.400 line:0%
so Minister Zhang

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:44.760 line:0%
will naturally have to explain

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:46.420 line:0%
to the grand empress dowager.

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:50.680 line:0%
How can we only watch half of the show?

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:52.120 line:0%
The bride's whereabouts

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:53.780 line:0%
is the Yan family's business.

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:54.960 line:0%
Of course I should

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:56.200 line:0%
send a team of bridesmaids tomorrow morning

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:57.560 line:0%
to fetch the bride.

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:06.750 line:0%
[Wedding]

00:13:17.430 --> 00:13:23.160 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:38.020 line:0%
[They left everything behind and eloped before the wedding.]

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:38.020 line:0%
[But I didn't expect my daughter to have someone she loves.]

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:38.020 line:0%
[The Yan family should be grateful for the marriage arranged by the grand empress dowager.]

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:46.020 line:0%
[Wedding]

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:43.280 line:0%
Everyone,

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:46.720 line:0%
you have worked in Yan's Mansion for many years.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.780 line:0%
Now the Yan family is in deep trouble.

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:52.130 line:0%
I'm afraid the Yan family's doom is fated.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:55.060 line:0%
I prepared some money for you all.

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:57.200 line:0%
Go make a living somewhere else.

00:14:17.520 --> 00:14:19.320 line:0%
I've already made a will.

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:21.450 line:0%
Mother!

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:23.920 line:0%
I don't want to die, Mother!

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:30.240 line:0%
Mother!

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:33.880 line:0%
Mother!

00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:38.920 line:0%
-Mother!
-Forget it.

00:14:40.200 --> 00:14:41.060 line:0%
I'll marry him.

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:48.640 line:0%
What time is it now?

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:50.280 line:0%
Why hasn't the bride come out yet?

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:52.540 line:0%
We're going to miss the auspicious time.

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:24.080 line:0%
♫I hope you also look up and see the radiant stars and moon♫

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:34.370 line:0%
♫No matter how vast the world is, I'll wait for your appearance♫

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:40.750 line:0%
♫A quick glance at each other♫

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:45.970 line:0%
♫Has warmed the winter in memories♫

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:53.960 line:0%
♫Don't mind the destined solitude, and shine brightly♫

00:15:57.140 --> 00:16:00.630 line:0%
♫I'll wait until the years blossom like flowers♫

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:05.310 line:0%
♫The ice and snow slowly melted♫

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:10.930 line:0%
♫I heard those tender words♫

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:16.020 line:0%
♫He told her, "I love you"♫

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:20.730 line:0%
♫What I saw in my dreams♫

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:25.660 line:0%
♫Is not a flashy illusion♫

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:31.460 line:0%
♫I don't fear the challenges ahead, riding a white horse to chase after time♫

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:31.680 line:0%
Xing!

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:34.770 line:0%
♫Let's go together♫

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:34.360 line:0%
Xing, you can't do this! Xing!

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:36.610 line:0%
Xing!

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:39.400 line:0%
I thought about it. I can't let you do this.

00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:39.880 line:0%
Think about it.

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:41.640 line:0%
What kind of person is the White Ghost?

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:42.600 line:0%
He crawled out

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:44.480 line:0%
of a pile of corpses of the Shen family.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.280 line:0%
It's not a good thing for you to marry into the Shen family.

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:47.120 line:0%
Run away now.

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:48.120 line:0%
Take this.

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:50.800 line:0%
You have many connections in the Ministry of Justice.

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:52.040 line:0%
Find a place and hide there

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:53.370 line:0%
for three months first.

00:16:53.520 --> 00:16:54.840 line:0%
You can come back home

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:56.100 line:0%
when things calm down.

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:58.290 line:0%
Don't worry about me.

00:16:58.400 --> 00:17:00.400 line:0%
Your father is just a paper tiger.

00:17:00.840 --> 00:17:02.170 line:0%
He can't do a thing to me.

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:03.869 line:0%
At worst,

00:17:03.869 --> 00:17:06.889 line:0%
I'll take good care of him for the rest of my life

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:10.780 line:0%
by serving tea and water and massaging his shoulders and legs.

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:15.280 line:0%
If it really doesn't work out,

00:17:15.280 --> 00:17:16.840 line:0%
just write a divorce letter

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:17.909 line:0%
to me.

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:19.629 line:0%
I'll return to my old profession—

00:17:19.629 --> 00:17:20.600 line:0%
an opera performer.

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:22.720 line:0%
I can still support us both.

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:23.440 line:0%
Mother,

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:24.960 line:0%
which theater

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:27.090 line:0%
would hire a white-haired performer?

00:17:27.680 --> 00:17:29.080 line:0%
Although I'm a concubine's daughter,

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:30.760 line:0%
I've been under your protection since childhood

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:32.760 line:0%
and haven't suffered many hardships.

00:17:32.760 --> 00:17:34.440 line:0%
And Sister Caiwei has been very nice to me.

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:35.160 line:0%
Back then,

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:36.800 line:0%
I didn't want to learn needlework

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:38.440 line:0%
and was determined to become a female official.

00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:39.200 line:0%
It was Sister Caiwei

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:40.440 line:0%
who knelt in the ancestral hall all night

00:17:40.440 --> 00:17:41.360 line:0%
to plead for me.

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:42.920 line:0%
You silly girl,

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:45.490 line:0%
you only remember the kindness of others.

00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:48.160 line:0%
I am a member of the Yan family,

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:48.720 line:0%
so naturally, I can't

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:50.760 line:0%
stand by and watch the Yan family suffer.

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:51.900 line:0%
Sister Caiwei doesn't want to marry him

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:53.680 line:0%
because she loves Mr. Han.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.280 line:0%
I have no one in my heart,

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:57.480 line:0%
so I'll just take her place to marry him.

00:17:58.140 --> 00:17:59.680 line:0%
Silly girl,

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:01.680 line:0%
getting married isn't that simple.

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:02.760 line:0%
Mother,

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:04.640 line:0%
don't worry.

00:18:04.840 --> 00:18:06.480 line:0%
I've seen plenty of dead people

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:07.760 line:0%
in the Ministry of Justice.

00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:08.840 line:0%
Dealing with

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:10.600 line:0%
the White Ghost is not a big deal.

00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:11.480 line:0%
Besides,

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:13.440 line:0%
he's only flesh and blood like us.

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:14.240 line:0%
He can't really

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:16.100 line:0%
drag me to the underworld, right?

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:21.640 line:0%
Alright.

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:39.280 line:0%
Father,

00:18:43.360 --> 00:18:44.160 line:0%
Madam,

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:48.940 line:0%
please take good care of my mother for me.

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:50.360 line:0%
I'm...

00:18:50.840 --> 00:18:51.880 line:0%
leaving now.

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:38.300 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:42.920 line:0%
Escort the bride!

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:12.240 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:13.240 line:0%
before the wedding ceremony,

00:20:13.240 --> 00:20:14.840 line:0%
the bride and the bridegroom shouldn't meet.

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:16.560 line:0%
Also, lowering the sedan chair midway is ominous.

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:17.840 line:0%
Besides, as the bridegroom,

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:19.320 line:0%
why aren't you wearing your wedding attire?

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:20.120 line:0%
Cut the crap.

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:21.480 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau is here to escort the bride.

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:23.160 line:0%
So we follow the Imperial Security Bureau's rules.

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:24.000 line:0%
Whether it's auspicious or not,

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:25.280 line:0%
it's up to Grand Commander.

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:25.880 line:0%
This...

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:32.320 line:0%
My dear wife,

00:20:35.800 --> 00:20:37.040 line:0%
I've come to see you,

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:44.280 line:0%
a lady from the Yan family

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:45.700 line:0%
who is famous in Xiang'an

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:48.360 line:0%
for being knowledgeable and virtuous.

00:21:05.640 --> 00:21:07.160 line:0%
This virtuous lady...

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:13.080 line:0%
is me.

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:32.000 line:0%
Grand Commander, do you plan

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:33.530 line:0%
to kill your wife in public?

00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:42.920 line:0%
Don't forget

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:46.160 line:0%
our marriage was arranged by the grand empress dowager.

00:21:46.160 --> 00:21:48.240 line:0%
Although I don't have an official rank now,

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:49.720 line:0%
and I'm not a court-appointed official,

00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:52.380 line:0%
I am at least a scribe in the Ministry of Justice.

00:21:52.640 --> 00:21:53.920 line:0%
This is not a crime scene,

00:21:53.920 --> 00:21:55.720 line:0%
and there's no suspect holding anyone hostage.

00:21:55.720 --> 00:21:57.720 line:0%
Even though you are the grand commander,

00:21:57.720 --> 00:21:59.200 line:0%
you can't just

00:21:59.360 --> 00:22:01.690 line:0%
kill an innocent scribe without a reason.

00:22:09.710 --> 00:22:10.640 line:0%
Is that so?

00:22:20.490 --> 00:22:21.600 line:0%
Since when

00:22:25.760 --> 00:22:28.000 line:0%
does a fly get to be a scribe?

00:22:34.600 --> 00:22:37.560 line:0%
Grand Commander, why do you have to humiliate me like this?

00:22:37.560 --> 00:22:38.720 line:0%
If you're so dissatisfied

00:22:38.720 --> 00:22:39.780 line:0%
with our marriage,

00:22:40.360 --> 00:22:42.020 line:0%
why don't you just kill me now?

00:22:46.640 --> 00:22:47.440 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:22:50.680 --> 00:22:51.820 line:0%
Today, I

00:22:53.000 --> 00:22:54.360 line:0%
have spared your life,

00:22:56.840 --> 00:22:57.840 line:0%
but soon,

00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:03.970 line:0%
I'll make your life a living hell.

00:23:21.120 --> 00:23:22.600 line:0%
Yan Xing is really bold.

00:23:23.080 --> 00:23:27.010 line:0%
She actually has the guts to take her third sister's place to marry you.

00:23:27.480 --> 00:23:29.200 line:0%
She's deceived the empress dowager. And that's a serious crime.

00:23:29.200 --> 00:23:30.160 line:0%
The grand empress dowager only said she arranged a marriage

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:31.720 line:0%
for me and a daughter of the Yan family.

00:23:31.720 --> 00:23:32.980 line:0%
As for which daughter,

00:23:33.800 --> 00:23:35.760 line:0%
the grand empress dowager doesn't care at all.

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:36.560 line:0%
But you...

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:37.920 line:0%
I care even less.

00:23:38.680 --> 00:23:40.810 line:0%
She'll be driven away sooner or later.

00:23:40.840 --> 00:23:41.840 line:0%
The Yan family doesn't have many

00:23:41.840 --> 00:23:43.100 line:0%
interesting rabbits.

00:23:43.960 --> 00:23:44.920 line:0%
The bold one

00:23:44.920 --> 00:23:46.120 line:0%
is more interesting.

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:47.840 line:0%
This is rare.

00:23:49.000 --> 00:23:50.240 line:0%
She's not just bold.

00:23:51.710 --> 00:23:53.600 line:0%
Looks like she's also clever.

00:24:01.480 --> 00:24:02.280 line:0%
Xing!

00:24:03.800 --> 00:24:04.600 line:0%
Xing!

00:24:07.080 --> 00:24:07.880 line:0%
Xing!

00:24:09.320 --> 00:24:10.290 line:0%
Chuichui?

00:24:11.560 --> 00:24:12.470 line:0%
Xing,

00:24:12.800 --> 00:24:14.140 line:0%
it really is you.

00:24:14.600 --> 00:24:15.360 line:0%
I heard

00:24:15.360 --> 00:24:16.800 line:0%
your third sister was getting married today.

00:24:16.800 --> 00:24:17.360 line:0%
I wanted to find you

00:24:17.360 --> 00:24:18.760 line:0%
to join in the fun together.

00:24:18.760 --> 00:24:19.480 line:0%
But

00:24:19.480 --> 00:24:20.480 line:0%
when I arrived at Yan's Mansion,

00:24:20.480 --> 00:24:21.880 line:0%
I saw Ms. Jin crying at the entrance.

00:24:21.880 --> 00:24:23.800 line:0%
She said you're the one who's getting married.

00:24:23.800 --> 00:24:24.600 line:0%
Xing,

00:24:24.640 --> 00:24:25.800 line:0%
are you unwilling?

00:24:28.040 --> 00:24:29.680 line:0%
But isn't the bridegroom

00:24:29.680 --> 00:24:31.000 line:0%
Shen Du?

00:24:32.400 --> 00:24:34.140 line:0%
He's not Shen Du anymore,

00:24:35.320 --> 00:24:37.310 line:0%
but the tyrannical White Ghost.

00:24:40.480 --> 00:24:41.400 line:0%
Don't worry, Chuichui.

00:24:41.400 --> 00:24:42.550 line:0%
Go back.

00:24:42.640 --> 00:24:43.510 line:0%
No.

00:24:43.680 --> 00:24:45.000 line:0%
How can I just watch you fall into the hands

00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:46.540 line:0%
of the White Ghost?

00:24:46.600 --> 00:24:47.600 line:0%
I'm going with you.

00:24:47.600 --> 00:24:48.400 line:0%
We'll

00:24:48.480 --> 00:24:49.720 line:0%
face this together.

00:24:53.680 --> 00:24:54.640 line:0%
This is bad!

00:24:54.640 --> 00:24:55.480 line:0%
What's wrong?

00:24:55.480 --> 00:24:56.680 line:0%
Calm down. Take your time.

00:24:56.680 --> 00:24:58.210 line:0%
The bride is on her way here.

00:24:58.560 --> 00:25:00.480 line:0%
[Shen Zhong, the butler of the Shen family]

00:24:59.870 --> 00:25:00.950 line:0%
The bride?

00:25:06.930 --> 00:25:12.460 line:0%
[Prudence and Reverence]

00:25:16.040 --> 00:25:19.070 line:0%
[Peace and Prosperity]

00:25:21.040 --> 00:25:22.840 line:0%
What special family rules?

00:25:23.720 --> 00:25:24.600 line:0%
Shen's Mansion looks

00:25:24.600 --> 00:25:26.040 line:0%
like a mourning hall.

00:25:26.960 --> 00:25:29.020 line:0%
It doesn't look like a wedding at all.

00:25:29.360 --> 00:25:33.550 line:0%
[Prudence and Reverence]

00:25:30.600 --> 00:25:32.000 line:0%
So many white lanterns.

00:25:47.560 --> 00:25:48.360 line:0%
Madam,

00:25:48.880 --> 00:25:51.080 line:0%
you've just arrived at Shen's Mansion.

00:25:51.120 --> 00:25:53.640 line:0%
We don't dare to be negligent.

00:25:55.040 --> 00:25:56.690 line:0%
Marriage

00:25:56.760 --> 00:25:59.360 line:0%
is all about the right time, place, and people.

00:25:59.370 --> 00:26:03.470 line:0%
[Peace and Prosperity]

00:26:00.000 --> 00:26:01.080 line:0%
A few days ago,

00:26:01.240 --> 00:26:02.320 line:0%
we consulted a master to analyze

00:26:02.320 --> 00:26:04.360 line:0%
the compatibility of your birth charts.

00:26:04.360 --> 00:26:06.290 line:0%
So today, the mansion shouldn't be

00:26:06.720 --> 00:26:08.920 line:0%
decorated with lanterns or streamers.

00:26:12.640 --> 00:26:13.440 line:0%
It's alright.

00:26:14.000 --> 00:26:15.480 line:0%
Mr. Shen, it's up to you.

00:26:16.040 --> 00:26:16.840 line:0%
Please.

00:26:22.020 --> 00:26:26.250 line:0%
[Peace and Prosperity]

00:26:30.120 --> 00:26:31.520 line:0%
The grand commander's central chamber,

00:26:31.520 --> 00:26:33.280 line:0%
due to his long years of solitary living,

00:26:33.280 --> 00:26:35.120 line:0%
lacks auspicious energy.

00:26:35.480 --> 00:26:37.640 line:0%
So it's unsuitable for being a bridal chamber,

00:26:37.640 --> 00:26:40.480 line:0%
as it may invite bloodshed.

00:26:41.160 --> 00:26:43.600 line:0%
We've specially prepared a new room for you.

00:26:43.600 --> 00:26:44.920 line:0%
Please rest early,

00:26:45.000 --> 00:26:47.440 line:0%
and wait for Grand Commander to return from his prayers.

00:26:47.440 --> 00:26:48.960 line:0%
Don't go too far!

00:26:51.720 --> 00:26:52.520 line:0%
It's alright.

00:26:54.760 --> 00:26:55.890 line:0%
Please lead the way.

00:26:56.760 --> 00:26:57.560 line:0%
Please.

00:26:59.000 --> 00:26:59.800 line:0%
Mr. Shen.

00:27:02.120 --> 00:27:03.640 line:0%
I wonder if you remember

00:27:03.760 --> 00:27:05.440 line:0%
what my birth chart is.

00:27:05.480 --> 00:27:06.280 line:0%
Well...

00:27:12.280 --> 00:27:13.520 line:0%
A lady's birth chart

00:27:13.520 --> 00:27:14.240 line:0%
is not something

00:27:14.240 --> 00:27:15.520 line:0%
to be spoken of in public.

00:27:15.520 --> 00:27:17.520 line:0%
Thank you for your thoughtfulness.

00:27:19.680 --> 00:27:20.480 line:0%
Please.

00:28:00.640 --> 00:28:01.160 line:0%
Chuichui,

00:28:01.160 --> 00:28:02.690 line:0%
have some preserved fruit.

00:28:03.280 --> 00:28:04.810 line:0%
You still have an appetite?

00:28:07.440 --> 00:28:08.280 line:0%
-Madam,
-Madam,

00:28:08.280 --> 00:28:13.600 line:0%
-we look forward to hearing the patter of tiny feet.
-we look forward to hearing the patter of tiny feet.

00:28:13.600 --> 00:28:14.720 line:0%
Now, really?

00:28:15.960 --> 00:28:16.760 line:0%
Did you never truly believe

00:28:16.760 --> 00:28:18.690 line:0%
Xing would marry into this family?

00:28:21.990 --> 00:28:22.920 line:0%
Chuichui,

00:28:23.280 --> 00:28:24.810 line:0%
don't give them a hard time.

00:28:37.880 --> 00:28:39.440 line:0%
They've gone too far.

00:28:40.480 --> 00:28:41.920 line:0%
I'm afraid they all thought

00:28:41.920 --> 00:28:43.360 line:0%
I would run away halfway.

00:28:44.440 --> 00:28:45.000 line:0%
But this is

00:28:45.000 --> 00:28:46.200 line:0%
too insulting.

00:28:46.960 --> 00:28:47.840 line:0%
It's okay.

00:28:48.080 --> 00:28:49.360 line:0%
Just empty formalities.

00:28:49.360 --> 00:28:50.440 line:0%
Empty formalities?

00:28:50.440 --> 00:28:53.040 line:0%
Your family suffered losses in real gifts too.

00:29:03.560 --> 00:29:04.480 line:0%
I heard

00:29:04.780 --> 00:29:07.110 line:0%
the gifts Shen Du delivered to your family

00:29:07.200 --> 00:29:08.680 line:0%
are nothing but showy trinkets.

00:29:08.680 --> 00:29:10.200 line:0%
They're nothing of real value.

00:29:10.200 --> 00:29:11.000 line:0%
This...

00:29:20.000 --> 00:29:20.720 line:0%
This is worse

00:29:20.720 --> 00:29:22.880 line:0%
than marrying into an ordinary family.

00:29:22.880 --> 00:29:24.410 line:0%
At least they'd be sincere.

00:29:24.520 --> 00:29:26.960 line:0%
Usually, the bride's family gets a pair of wild geese for the wedding,

00:29:26.960 --> 00:29:28.820 line:0%
but your family only got a big hen.

00:29:29.960 --> 00:29:31.490 line:0%
How are you still laughing?

00:29:34.510 --> 00:29:36.370 line:0%
Since he doesn't want to marry me,

00:29:36.400 --> 00:29:37.920 line:0%
I insist on marrying him.

00:29:46.450 --> 00:29:48.520 line:0%
[Three]

00:29:49.400 --> 00:29:50.520 line:0%
Grand Commander, bad news!

00:29:50.520 --> 00:29:52.520 line:0%
I've received news from the guards!

00:29:55.240 --> 00:29:56.440 line:0%
That bride is truly something else.

00:29:56.440 --> 00:29:57.040 line:0%
Not only did she not leave,

00:29:57.040 --> 00:29:58.000 line:0%
she actually came back.

00:29:58.000 --> 00:30:00.600 line:0%
Now she's probably in Shen's Mansion already.

00:30:00.880 --> 00:30:02.440 line:0%
Yan Xing is indeed something.

00:30:02.440 --> 00:30:03.200 line:0%
The point is

00:30:03.200 --> 00:30:04.280 line:0%
nobody thought the wedding would

00:30:04.280 --> 00:30:05.000 line:0%
actually happen.

00:30:05.000 --> 00:30:06.520 line:0%
They didn't prepare anything.

00:30:06.520 --> 00:30:07.400 line:0%
But she

00:30:07.400 --> 00:30:08.760 line:0%
went to help with the arrangements.

00:30:08.760 --> 00:30:09.360 line:0%
And now she's even there

00:30:09.360 --> 00:30:10.490 line:0%
giving them advice.

00:30:12.480 --> 00:30:13.200 line:0%
Let her be.

00:30:19.040 --> 00:30:20.120 line:0%
In the past, there were indeed many fearless women

00:30:20.120 --> 00:30:21.080 line:0%
who tried to pester you in order to marry

00:30:21.080 --> 00:30:22.040 line:0%
into the Shen family.

00:30:22.040 --> 00:30:22.920 line:0%
But with just a little bit

00:30:22.920 --> 00:30:23.880 line:0%
of your tricks,

00:30:23.880 --> 00:30:25.600 line:0%
they immediately ran away.

00:30:25.680 --> 00:30:26.640 line:0%
None of them ever dared to enter

00:30:26.640 --> 00:30:28.000 line:0%
the bridal chamber after seeing your sword.

00:30:28.000 --> 00:30:28.840 line:0%
After she entered the mansion,

00:30:28.840 --> 00:30:29.880 line:0%
Mr. Shen deliberately withheld

00:30:29.880 --> 00:30:30.720 line:0%
the betrothal gifts.

00:30:30.720 --> 00:30:32.760 line:0%
Instead of getting angry, she insisted on marrying you.

00:30:32.760 --> 00:30:34.920 line:0%
This woman is well-trained

00:30:34.920 --> 00:30:36.080 line:0%
and faces challenges head-on.

00:30:36.080 --> 00:30:37.000 line:0%
Since Minister Zhang sent her here,

00:30:37.000 --> 00:30:38.280 line:0%
there must be a major conspiracy behind it.

00:30:37.850 --> 00:30:39.030 line:0%
[Lu]

00:30:42.480 --> 00:30:43.960 line:0%
If even you can see through it,

00:30:43.960 --> 00:30:46.160 line:0%
how can it still be called a conspiracy?

00:30:51.160 --> 00:30:52.520 line:0%
The rabbit this time...

00:30:55.840 --> 00:30:57.240 line:0%
is much more interesting

00:30:59.360 --> 00:31:01.440 line:0%
than the previous ones.

00:31:08.840 --> 00:31:11.100 line:0%
Regarding the official matchmakers...

00:31:11.800 --> 00:31:13.120 line:0%
Grand Commander, please rest assured.

00:31:13.120 --> 00:31:14.800 line:0%
I have already warned

00:31:14.800 --> 00:31:16.160 line:0%
the wedding procession.

00:31:16.160 --> 00:31:18.280 line:0%
Now everyone will simply believe the wedding

00:31:18.280 --> 00:31:20.080 line:0%
went smoothly, and the ceremony

00:31:20.320 --> 00:31:21.920 line:0%
has been completed.

00:31:46.040 --> 00:31:47.320 line:0%
Now I understand

00:31:47.320 --> 00:31:49.160 line:0%
why Shen Du is called the White Ghost.

00:31:49.160 --> 00:31:50.680 line:0%
Look at all these.

00:31:51.440 --> 00:31:53.280 line:0%
During the day, it already looked like a mourning hall.

00:31:53.280 --> 00:31:54.240 line:0%
At night,

00:31:54.520 --> 00:31:56.380 line:0%
it's still as bright as daylight.

00:31:56.720 --> 00:31:58.600 line:0%
Is he trying to light up the underworld

00:31:58.600 --> 00:31:59.860 line:0%
and guide the spirits?

00:32:02.240 --> 00:32:04.720 line:0%
I'm afraid it's because he's worried ghosts might knock on his door at midnight

00:32:04.720 --> 00:32:06.780 line:0%
given what he's done all these years.

00:32:11.120 --> 00:32:12.120 line:0%
Xing,

00:32:12.840 --> 00:32:13.830 line:0%
do you really

00:32:13.920 --> 00:32:14.720 line:0%
feel nothing but disgust

00:32:14.720 --> 00:32:16.160 line:0%
for the White Ghost now?

00:32:19.010 --> 00:32:20.760 line:0%
When I was young, I was blind

00:32:20.760 --> 00:32:22.360 line:0%
and thought he was a good man.

00:32:22.490 --> 00:32:23.720 line:0%
After these past few days,

00:32:23.720 --> 00:32:25.000 line:0%
I've seen through him.

00:32:25.120 --> 00:32:27.020 line:0%
Then what about those words he said when he stopped the sedan chair?

00:32:27.020 --> 00:32:29.280 line:0%
He probably didn't want me to enter the mansion.

00:32:29.280 --> 00:32:31.120 line:0%
He was just trying to scare me away.

00:32:31.120 --> 00:32:32.520 line:0%
Then what should you do?

00:32:33.160 --> 00:32:34.230 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:32:34.360 --> 00:32:35.080 line:0%
After all, our marriage

00:32:35.080 --> 00:32:37.640 line:0%
was arranged by the grand empress dowager personally.

00:32:37.640 --> 00:32:38.720 line:0%
He won't do anything

00:32:38.720 --> 00:32:39.780 line:0%
against me for now.

00:32:40.240 --> 00:32:41.640 line:0%
I'll be cautious

00:32:41.660 --> 00:32:43.190 line:0%
and take it one day at a time.

00:32:43.640 --> 00:32:45.000 line:0%
At the very least, I'll hold out

00:32:45.000 --> 00:32:46.760 line:0%
until the court finalizes the list of officials for external assignments,

00:32:46.760 --> 00:32:47.520 line:0%
so that my family

00:32:47.520 --> 00:32:49.180 line:0%
won't be exiled to the desert.

00:32:49.240 --> 00:32:50.800 line:0%
This isn't a marriage.

00:32:50.880 --> 00:32:53.080 line:0%
This is like stepping into a den of demons.

00:32:53.080 --> 00:32:54.600 line:0%
Surviving in the underworld

00:32:54.600 --> 00:32:55.720 line:0%
is not that easy.

00:32:57.200 --> 00:32:58.200 line:0%
It's getting late.

00:32:58.200 --> 00:32:59.040 line:0%
You should go back now.

00:32:59.040 --> 00:33:00.770 line:0%
Or your father will be worried.

00:33:01.080 --> 00:33:01.960 line:0%
I'm not leaving.

00:33:01.960 --> 00:33:03.480 line:0%
I want to stay here with you.

00:33:03.480 --> 00:33:05.740 line:0%
Can you come to keep me company every day?

00:33:06.520 --> 00:33:08.200 line:0%
Don't risk yourself too.

00:33:09.280 --> 00:33:10.400 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:33:10.480 --> 00:33:11.280 line:0%
Tonight,

00:33:11.280 --> 00:33:12.360 line:0%
I'm sure he will put on an air

00:33:12.360 --> 00:33:13.920 line:0%
of indifference and disdain towards me.

00:33:13.920 --> 00:33:15.450 line:0%
He won't come to my chamber.

00:34:31.720 --> 00:34:32.720 line:0%
Why are you here?

00:35:17.680 --> 00:35:19.010 line:0%
This is Shen's Mansion.

00:35:20.320 --> 00:35:21.920 line:0%
Tonight is my wedding night.

00:35:22.760 --> 00:35:24.120 line:0%
Why can't I come?

00:35:27.720 --> 00:35:28.680 line:0%
But look at you.

00:35:31.000 --> 00:35:32.560 line:0%
The Yan family has a daughter,

00:35:32.560 --> 00:35:34.090 line:0%
gifted in poetry and prose,

00:35:34.440 --> 00:35:35.840 line:0%
graceful with brush and ink,

00:35:35.840 --> 00:35:37.240 line:0%
well-versed, virtuous,

00:35:37.400 --> 00:35:38.530 line:0%
and knowledgeable.

00:35:39.440 --> 00:35:41.300 line:0%
Her reputation as a virtuous lady

00:35:41.560 --> 00:35:43.020 line:0%
is unmatched in Xiang'an.

00:35:44.440 --> 00:35:45.440 line:0%
Which

00:35:47.040 --> 00:35:48.840 line:0%
of those descriptions fits you?

00:35:54.560 --> 00:35:55.560 line:0%
We do.

00:35:56.120 --> 00:35:57.480 line:0%
The grand empress dowager must think

00:35:57.480 --> 00:35:58.960 line:0%
that you and I

00:35:59.000 --> 00:36:02.160 line:0%
are a perfect match.

00:36:02.760 --> 00:36:05.820 line:0%
Otherwise, why would she have arranged this marriage?

00:36:05.880 --> 00:36:06.840 line:0%
Grand Commander, if you

00:36:06.840 --> 00:36:08.300 line:0%
are not satisfied with me,

00:36:08.560 --> 00:36:09.890 line:0%
you can just divorce me.

00:36:17.920 --> 00:36:19.600 line:0%
The fanciful thoughts

00:36:22.160 --> 00:36:23.960 line:0%
in your head echo

00:36:26.780 --> 00:36:28.360 line:0%
your pretty face.

00:36:54.360 --> 00:36:56.890 line:0%
You're such a pretty and charming young lady.

00:36:59.280 --> 00:37:01.120 line:0%
I should cherish you dearly.

00:37:02.500 --> 00:37:04.640 line:0%
Why would I easily divorce you?

00:37:13.880 --> 00:37:15.560 line:0%
I've never seen a bride running around the courtyard

00:37:15.560 --> 00:37:17.690 line:0%
before the ceremony is even complete.

00:37:18.240 --> 00:37:20.110 line:0%
If you don't want to accidentally

00:37:21.000 --> 00:37:22.360 line:0%
break a leg or lose an arm

00:37:23.100 --> 00:37:24.560 line:0%
in Shen's Mansion,

00:37:25.840 --> 00:37:27.500 line:0%
remember to behave yourself.

00:37:56.590 --> 00:37:58.040 line:0%
You're right, Honey.

00:37:59.280 --> 00:38:00.120 line:0%
Honey,

00:38:01.600 --> 00:38:03.480 line:0%
since I've accepted the imperial decree,

00:38:03.480 --> 00:38:04.960 line:0%
of course I should fulfill my duty

00:38:04.960 --> 00:38:07.290 line:0%
as Mrs. Shen in Grand Commander's Mansion

00:38:07.720 --> 00:38:09.160 line:0%
and serve you

00:38:09.680 --> 00:38:11.940 line:0%
with utmost care and attention.

00:38:16.960 --> 00:38:18.080 line:0%
You think you can

00:38:19.000 --> 00:38:20.520 line:0%
seduce me like this?

00:39:01.320 --> 00:39:03.520 line:0%
Since you said you want to serve me well,

00:39:04.120 --> 00:39:06.080 line:0%
let me tell you three things.

00:39:08.680 --> 00:39:09.480 line:0%
First,

00:39:10.960 --> 00:39:11.960 line:0%
don't expect to become

00:39:11.960 --> 00:39:13.400 line:0%
the true Mrs. Shen.

00:39:14.160 --> 00:39:15.320 line:0%
We are a couple

00:39:15.920 --> 00:39:17.120 line:0%
in name only.

00:39:18.160 --> 00:39:18.960 line:0%
Second,

00:39:20.160 --> 00:39:21.400 line:0%
don't expect to get

00:39:21.400 --> 00:39:22.800 line:0%
any information from me.

00:39:24.280 --> 00:39:25.640 line:0%
I know why Minister Zhang

00:39:25.640 --> 00:39:26.800 line:0%
sent you here.

00:39:30.800 --> 00:39:31.600 line:0%
Third,

00:39:33.200 --> 00:39:34.080 line:0%
you're not someone

00:39:34.080 --> 00:39:36.040 line:0%
I willingly married.

00:39:36.720 --> 00:39:39.120 line:0%
Don't expect to survive in Shen's Mansion.

00:40:28.200 --> 00:40:29.000 line:0%
Sir,

00:40:30.280 --> 00:40:31.440 line:0%
you've met Madam?

00:40:33.000 --> 00:40:34.400 line:0%
Then the wedding ceremony...

00:40:34.400 --> 00:40:35.680 line:0%
Consider it done.

00:40:36.200 --> 00:40:37.000 line:0%
Then...

00:40:37.280 --> 00:40:38.720 line:0%
the west wing...

00:40:44.920 --> 00:40:46.240 line:0%
Let her stay there.

00:40:46.480 --> 00:40:47.480 line:0%
Grand Commander!

00:40:47.920 --> 00:40:48.920 line:0%
Grand Commander!

00:40:50.280 --> 00:40:51.610 line:0%
The Ming Hall is on fire.

00:40:53.810 --> 00:40:54.650 line:0%
Hurry up!

00:40:54.680 --> 00:40:55.640 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:40:55.640 --> 00:40:56.920 line:0%
How did the Ming Hall catch fire?

00:40:56.920 --> 00:40:58.120 line:0%
Someone set himself on fire inside,

00:40:58.120 --> 00:40:59.280 line:0%
which started the blaze.

00:40:59.280 --> 00:40:59.840 line:0%
The person who self-immolated

00:40:59.840 --> 00:41:01.200 line:0%
has been burned beyond recognition.

00:41:01.200 --> 00:41:02.340 line:0%
Immediately dispatch more men to ensure

00:41:02.340 --> 00:41:04.200 line:0%
the security of the imperial palace.

00:41:04.200 --> 00:41:06.000 line:0%
Investigate the identity of the self-immolator thoroughly.

00:41:06.000 --> 00:41:07.320 line:0%
Leave no stone unturned.

00:41:07.320 --> 00:41:08.000 line:0%
Yes.

00:41:15.260 --> 00:41:19.850 line:0%
[Ming Hall]

00:41:22.000 --> 00:41:23.360 line:0%
Why won't you let us meet?

00:41:23.360 --> 00:41:25.200 line:0%
I am a female official from the Ministry of Justice.

00:41:25.200 --> 00:41:26.000 line:0%
Yesterday,

00:41:26.000 --> 00:41:26.840 line:0%
I accompanied her

00:41:26.840 --> 00:41:28.240 line:0%
into the bridal chamber.

00:41:28.400 --> 00:41:30.000 line:0%
Miss, you really can't go in.

00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:30.600 line:0%
Without the steward's order...

00:41:30.600 --> 00:41:31.200 line:0%
Please.

00:41:31.200 --> 00:41:32.360 line:0%
We can't let you in.

00:41:32.360 --> 00:41:33.160 line:0%
That's right.

00:41:33.840 --> 00:41:34.480 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:41:34.480 --> 00:41:35.240 line:0%
You can't go in.

00:41:35.240 --> 00:41:35.960 line:0%
Xing,

00:41:36.480 --> 00:41:38.410 line:0%
something terrible has happened!

00:41:40.040 --> 00:41:40.970 line:0%
-Madam.
-Madam.

00:41:46.200 --> 00:41:47.360 line:0%
Near the bamboo forest of the Ximing Temple,

00:41:47.360 --> 00:41:49.090 line:0%
someone found a pair of bodies.

00:41:50.800 --> 00:41:52.660 line:0%
The bodies look very weird.

00:41:52.940 --> 00:41:53.840 line:0%
The Ministry of Justice and constables

00:41:53.840 --> 00:41:55.000 line:0%
have already sent people there.

00:41:55.000 --> 00:41:55.530 line:0%
Let's go.

00:41:55.720 --> 00:41:56.120 line:0%
Let's go.